    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/f21d2b3030b5b7544d023b9284b0a8ac.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>This game is all about capturing flags. Fight your way into enemy territory and steal their flag. Use hidden paths and clever routes to sneak past enemy defenses. Once you\u2019ve got the flag, you\u2019ll be target number one. Team up with friends, cover each other, and battle your way to victory.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/89b77c0727c9f0ec9da3451db901c0a3.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/89b77c0727c9f0ec9da3451db901c0a3.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/02aab62c194ed2614f7c63a699a9f558.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>Fast-paced 5v5 action built for skillful play. Jump into quick, intense matches with friends or solo. Choose from 6 distinct classes, each with its own team role, like the speedy Runner for flag captures or the Support class for covering teammates from afar. Find your playstyle, own your role, and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, tough to master \u2014 that\u2019s where the real challenge and fun begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2ef15ea7573d6e38f821e76c8ce21aab.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2ef15ea7573d6e38f821e76c8ce21aab.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/abe7bdab36ad1992f2badaf0ad626a2a.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>There\u2019s tons of gear to unlock. Earn coins by playing rounds and explore the shop for outfits, weapons, bow skins, arrows, tattoos, and more. Mix and match to create your own unique look, and now it\u2019s time to flex on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/509c8ff22cfd6aba27ef5558601f5357.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/509c8ff22cfd6aba27ef5558601f5357.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2542511a339e199e72008c4079c8d5bb.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>There are 17+ unique maps to explore, each with its own vibe and secrets. From Samurai castles and desert oases to Viking forts and Greek sky temples, every map has their own theme. Alternate map versions will force you to adapt your routes. Plus, changing weather every round means you\u2019ll need to stay sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/0a8baab0efc215b855032c6bdac8e894.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/0a8baab0efc215b855032c6bdac8e894.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5 online multiplayer flag capture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different bows with\u00a0customisable skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different melee weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller, touchscreen &amp; gamepad  support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17+ unique maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly gamemodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/f21d2b3030b5b7544d023b9284b0a8ac.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>This game is all about capturing flags. Fight your way into enemy territory and steal their flag. Use hidden paths and clever routes to sneak past enemy defenses. Once you\u2019ve got the flag, you\u2019ll be target number one. Team up with friends, cover each other, and battle your way to victory.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/89b77c0727c9f0ec9da3451db901c0a3.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/89b77c0727c9f0ec9da3451db901c0a3.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/02aab62c194ed2614f7c63a699a9f558.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>Fast-paced 5v5 action built for skillful play. Jump into quick, intense matches with friends or solo. Choose from 6 distinct classes, each with its own team role, like the speedy Runner for flag captures or the Support class for covering teammates from afar. Find your playstyle, own your role, and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, tough to master \u2014 that\u2019s where the real challenge and fun begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2ef15ea7573d6e38f821e76c8ce21aab.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2ef15ea7573d6e38f821e76c8ce21aab.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/abe7bdab36ad1992f2badaf0ad626a2a.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>There\u2019s tons of gear to unlock. Earn coins by playing rounds and explore the shop for outfits, weapons, bow skins, arrows, tattoos, and more. Mix and match to create your own unique look, and now it\u2019s time to flex on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/509c8ff22cfd6aba27ef5558601f5357.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/509c8ff22cfd6aba27ef5558601f5357.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/2542511a339e199e72008c4079c8d5bb.avif?t=1753701539\" width=616 height=62 /></span>There are 17+ unique maps to explore, each with its own vibe and secrets. From Samurai castles and desert oases to Viking forts and Greek sky temples, every map has their own theme. Alternate map versions will force you to adapt your routes. Plus, changing weather every round means you\u2019ll need to stay sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/0a8baab0efc215b855032c6bdac8e894.poster.avif?t=1753701539\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788170/extras/0a8baab0efc215b855032c6bdac8e894.webp?t=1753701539\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=185 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5 online multiplayer flag capture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different bows with\u00a0customisable skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different melee weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller, touchscreen &amp; gamepad  support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17+ unique maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly gamemodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
